'''Balaluga''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that was implemented in [[Version 3.4 Update|Version 3.4]] and can be unlocked by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Tales of the Nekoluga (Gacha Event)|Tales of the Nekoluga]] event. [[True Form]] added in [[Version 6.2 Update|Version 6.2]] increases [[Freeze|freeze]] duration and [[Weaken|weakens]] enemies. [[Talents]] were added in [[Version 13.7 Update|Version 13.7]].

